# Entity Notes

> **For future Claude**: This directory contains one note per person, company, or tool. All notes follow the `type: person` or `type: entity` schema.

## Note Types
- `type: person` - Individual people
- `type: company` - Companies and organizations
- `type: tool` - Tools, libraries, frameworks

## Frontmatter Schema
```yaml
---
date: YYYY-MM-DD
type: person
tags: [person, entity]
role: ""
company: "[[Companies/...]]"
relationship: weak | medium | strong
last-interaction: YYYY-MM-DD
related-projects: ["[[Projects/...]]", ...]
ai-first: true
---
```

## Naming Convention
- People: `Firstname Lastname.md` (e.g., `Florian.md`)
- Companies: `Company Name.md` (e.g., `GameMode.md`)
- Tools: `Tool Name.md` (e.g., `Discord IPC.md`)
